The JPEG decoder (src/jpeg.rs) computes its inverse DCT, chroma upsampling
and colour conversion with the integer formulas of the Independent JPEG
Group's libjpeg (jidctint.c, jdsample.c and jdcolor.c), written again in
Rust. No source code of libjpeg is included. In the words the IJG asks for:
this software is based in part on the work of the Independent JPEG Group.
